+# cfm_x_sq: as cfm_x_s, but the network sees only the cell argmax(y) of its label (a label bottleneck,
+#   Proposition prop:bottleneck): its optimum at cell k is the exact field of the averaged prior
+#   pbar_k = (alpha, (1-alpha)/2, (1-alpha)/2), a vertex prior with B_Q = log(2 alpha/(1-alpha)).
+# cfm_x_o: asinh(t (x - C_OFF)/eps^2), centred off the tie; cfm_x_a: asinh(t (x - a_k)/eps^2) for the
